# The image build needs four things; everything else stays out of the build context (M11.1).
# An allow-list, not a deny-list: a new file (a .env, a dump, a key) is excluded until someone
# decides the build needs it, so `COPY . .` can never bake a local secret into a layer (and deleting
# it in a later layer would not remove it from the earlier one).
*
!.mvn/
!mvnw
!pom.xml
!src/main/

# Belt and braces, should someone widen the list above.
.env
.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
